WEBVTT

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.160
Oh? You said your name was Aku, right?

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.290
"Aku"
Oh? You said your name was Aku, right?

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.660
From now on, you should call me Sister Luna.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.290
"Luna Elegant"
From now on, you should call me Sister Luna.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.410
Is it okay for me to speak
to a Holy Maiden like that?

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:31.450
I say it's fine, so it's fine. I make the rules.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:32.700
Right...

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.830
Besides, we get along well enough
to see each other naked!

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.080
Here I come!

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.160
Don't! Anywhere but there!

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:49.950
"Demon Lord"
"Hakuto Kunai"

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.790
Administrator Privileges. Item File.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.000
In <i>Infinity Game</i>,

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.540
"Tiara"
each player couldn't hold any more than 10 items.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:13.370
Getting to store infinite items
like this makes things much easier.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.040
Luna, got a minute?

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:21.160
Excuse me? I don't remember saying
you can call me by my first name.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:25.540
Whatever. Just tell me everything
you know about the Cherub.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:31.330
Um, Sister Luna? Demon Lord isn't
very knowledgeable about this stuff.

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.290
If it's not any trouble, could you tell him?

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:38.370
The Cherub deceased after
sealing the Demon King Greole

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:40.620
because it used up all of its power.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.620
You don't say...

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.660
But the Kingdom of Holy Light
still has the Ophan and Seraph

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:49.870
who serve to guide the people.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:53.910
It's absurd to think the peace of
this kingdom could be threatened.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.500
"Officer" "Mount Fuji"
Sister! We've almost reached the city of Yahoo!

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:09.700
"Deranged Holy Maiden" "Killer Queen"
Good. Let's tie a rope around that
shitty brat's neck and drag her home.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:13.540
Isn't subduing a Demon Lord
a manly thing for her to try?

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:18.120
We're all pretty impressed
by the gusto of your little sister.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:23.200
You're all morons.
That shit is just trying to stand out.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.540
As if a Demon Lord exists
in the first place, idiot.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:30.370
But people are saying that Greole
was killed by someone!

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:32.500
Hmph, you meathead...

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.200
How dare my big sister
withhold information from me...

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:41.250
Did you think you could
ever beat me, you shithead?

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:49.950
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:56.500
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.080
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:03.370
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.790
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:15.620
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:22.120
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:28.950
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:36.200
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:41.500
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.950
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.370
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.830
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.120
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:58.790
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:01.950
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.540
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:07.160
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.160
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:16.950
"Killer Queen"

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.870
I've grasped the Cherub situation for now.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:32.160
So? Where can I find the Ophan and Seraph then?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:37.040
Who knows? It's been ages
since anyone's seen either of them.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:40.160
Oh, it's just a legend then...

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.290
Some misguided believers
think that the stone statue

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.700
at the Wishing Shrine is actually the Ophan.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:50.080
They'll get divine retribution for that someday.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:55.540
If that Idol was actually the Ophan...

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:01.000
I was once very pure and a sight to behold...

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:07.200
But many years of granting wicked
wishes to humans changed me to this.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.950
I'm not well-informed enough
to form a plan just yet.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.250
I've gotta gather more info
in the Holy Capital...

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:19.160
But before that, I need to do something
about this empty wallet of mine.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:27.250
In my motherland, we highly value
and appreciate elegance.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:31.410
Everyone presents their finest
wares when serving tea.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:36.370
You'll embarrass your family if you
put out something that looks cheap.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.250
Oho... That's very interesting.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:45.410
And today I have brought my favorite
tea bowl from my motherland.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:45.830
Oh! How splendid it is!

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.120
"Fine Art Shop" "Nanden-Manden"
Oh! How splendid it is!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:54.910
As in this trash I made with a few
skill points that gives just 1 Offense?!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.370
I just don't get it...

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.950
How much would it cost for you to part with it?

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:05.250
Oh, no... Think of this as a token
in hopes of establishing

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.080
a long and lasting partnership.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:11.500
But, seeing as how I don't
have much money on hand,

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:16.450
I'd accept one giant gold coin
as collateral if you're willing.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.750
O-One giant gold coin?

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:23.500
Hmm? That looked like the most
expensive coin in Luna's bag, so...

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.660
...I thought I should start with that, but...

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:30.870
I've heard the incredible rumors about you.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:34.750
They say you're a cultured man
who descended from royalty

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.450
as well as a tolerant
and accepting gentleman.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.910
Who would spread such baseless rumors?

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:45.950
I'm sure you must have
your reasons for denying it.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:50.290
I promise I won't speak of it,
so you need not worry.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:54.330
I accept your proposition.
Let me get things ready for you.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.700
I appreciate your understanding.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.580
But before that, I must ask one thing.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:06.370
If you end up selling the tea bowl,
take nothing less than five giant gold coins.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:10.080
F-Five giant gold coins? That's...

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:14.250
If you can't promise me that,
let's say this conversation never happened.

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:17.160
W-Wait, please! I understand.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.870
I promise, I'll uphold your wish.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:23.120
That sold for a ton more
than I thought it would!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:27.080
The value of stuff is way
different than <i>Infinity Game</i>!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:30.620
Nice... I'll invite Aku and Luna
to dinner or something.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.250
Luna! Get out here!

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:43.500
We demon-believing Satanists
failed in summoning the Demon Lord.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:49.540
But if it resulted in the Holy Maidens
taking action, it was not done in vain.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.830
"Satanist" "Walking"
Just as planned, we will eradicate

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:54.040
"Satanist" "Walking"
the Holy Maidens from this world.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:59.450
May disaster befall the Maidens.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:11.950
The second eldest Holy Maiden,
Killer Queen, has come!

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.540
Luna! Get out here!

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:27.830
Now there's a handful of a sister!
Talk about deranged...

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:31.870
And while we're at it, if there's
a Demon Lord, get your ass out here!

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:36.290
Yeah, right, idiot!
Go back to your post-apocalyptic world!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:40.080
Out of the way! I said move it!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.290
Hey, Sister! What are you doing here?!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:48.200
You little shit. How dare you run off
to play with fire without me knowing.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:51.080
I-I just heard a Demon Lord appeared and--

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:55.040
You imbecile!
What the hell can you do on your own?!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.790
Instead of subduing
a Demon Lord that doesn't exist...

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:00.500
...stay in your bed and sleep, you shit!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.160
S-Sister, you don't get it!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:06.500
There is a Demon Lord
and I used my charms to tame him!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.040
Oh? Talking in your sleep is quite the feat...

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:14.200
He really exists! And...
he's completely obsessed with my butt!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.790
Huh? Your butt?!

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:21.950
Ugh... I get where she's coming from,
but this makes it sound way worse...

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.120
Death to the phony angel.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.160
Firebird!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.200
May grief befall the Maidens.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.290
Ice Hammer!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.080
No!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.080
Fuji!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:42.910
Sister!

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.410
Where have I seen those outfits?

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.870
The Wishing...?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.040
Those slain guys at the
Wishing Shrine wore that too...

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:10.080
Nice to meet you too, Satanist scum!

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.290
Idiots should just die!

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.040
Gold Splash!

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.370
Wipe out the damn Satanists!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.910
A blood sacrifice for Sister!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:34.700
Once this fight is over,
I'm gonna get Sister to abuse me!

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:40.080
Satanist scum! How's it feel
to be stained in crimson?!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:45.580
You should feel honored
to die at the hands of my magic!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.200
You evil cretins!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.410
You're the evil ones
no matter how you look at it...

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:51.410
Hmm?

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:58.080
This is my prized darkness, but...

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.500
If it's in exchange for
two Holy Maidens, so be it!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.700
What's this?!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.410
Luna, get back!

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:14.700
It's Hades!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.580
You fools. Your divine protection is gone.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.450
Shoot down the Holy Maidens!

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.200
This is looking bad.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:49.080
What are you hesitating for?

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:52.000
Why not toss a grenade that way

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.450
and kill everyone all at once?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.200
You're insane. What's wrong with you?

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:02.450
If I killed the Holy Maidens,
I'd just get my face put on the wanted list.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:08.080
And what about it?
Both that woman and this kingdom...

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:11.200
...are already trying to kill the Demon Lord.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:23.200
Yes... Now it's become the legitimate
self-defense you love so much...

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.660
You should be thankful.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:29.080
Shit... My body isn't moving how I want!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:36.580
Don't I have anything to help me
get out of this situation?

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.080
"Character Change"
"Unable to Control"

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:40.870
What?

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:47.040
At this rate, I guess I've got no choice!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:57.000
"Killer Queen" "Race: Human"
"Sex: Female" "Age: 17" "Height: 170-173cm"

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:02.040
"Mount Fuji" "Race: Human"
"Sex: Male" "Age: 28" "Height: 2m"

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.750
And? Where's this?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.870
Who the hell are you?

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:39.950
What?

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:51.330
Tsk! What kind of weaklings are you,
menacing women and children?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.950
That bastard must be a Holy Maiden goon!
Who cares! Get him!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.660
You guys want a piece of me?!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.120
"Grudge Setting"

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.290
You're all a bunch of one-punch weaklings!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.660
Who the hell is that?!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:26.410
What's with that snazzy
white outfit of his?! It's so sick!

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:30.660
Wh-Who the hell are you? What do you want?!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:34.040
Considering you're a bunch
of cowards harassing women,

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.160
you don't deserve to know my name.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:41.870
"W-Woman"? He called me a woman?!

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:45.580
Then again, this shame
I'm feeling isn't half bad...

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:50.160
He's probably just one of the Holy Knights!
Don't be afraid! He--

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.870
So quick!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:02.410
How is he that fast?!
All I could see was a blur!

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:04.540
Hey! Did you see that, Luna?!

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.290
Tsk! You worthless shit!

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.910
It's go time, punks!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:18.830
"Kenpo"

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.410
Dance for me!

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:27.580
"Hand-to-hand Combat"

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.700
Don't you know?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.700
None can flee from the dragon!

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:02.450
"Final Phoenix"

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:16.080
You gutless worms are a thousand years
too early to face the dragon.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:20.080
H-He's so cool!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.620
This city ain't one I remember...

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.250
You all right over there, woman?

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.160
Y-Yes!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.290
You're damn reckless.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:33.410
Why's a woman going up
against guys with weapons?

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:39.830
H-He's worried about me?
How long has it been since that's happened?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:44.830
If that trash ever messes with you again,
you just let me know.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.040
I'll come running to rescue you.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:53.450
I can't take it! He's killing my heart!
I'm dead four times over!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:57.700
When I'm around this guy,
I just can't seem to act like myself!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:02.330
Argh! I'll die if someone
sees me like this! I will!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:07.040
U-Um, would you be so kind as
to tell me your name, please?

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.790
I'll strangle you later.
I'll squeeze the life out of you.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.660
Hmm? I'm Zero.

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.540
Zero Kirisame.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:22.790
Zero? Um, I'm sorry for
dragging you into all this...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.540
No need to make such a pitiful face.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:31.330
I'm pretty much the definition
of unrivaled, you know.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:35.450
An insignificant brawl like that
doesn't even count to me.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.950
M-My nose is gonna bleed!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:42.620
Looks like a few people got hurt,
so go and take care of 'em.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.080
I'm gettin' out of here.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.620
O-Okay!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.700
Zero Kirisame...

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.290
"Dons the Silver Dragon" "Zero Kirisame"
Zero Kirisame...

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:57.950
I finally found him... The man of my destiny!

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.450
You monster...

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:10.000
At least I was lucky enough to recover Hades.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.660
Those with dragon blood
on the side of fighting evil...

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:17.790
Those who look on the ground
with disdain, Dragonkin...

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:22.500
Have they formed a secret union
with the Kingdom of Holy Light?

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.660
Demon Lord!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.910
It's a good thing I ran into you here.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.910
Shit, someone! Someone please kill me!

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:37.790
The definition of unrivaled, my ass!
You're a frickin' imbecile!

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.700
Argh, wall!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.120
U-Um, Demon Lord?

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.290
Huh? What? No, this is...

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:47.870
A-Anyways, Aku... Did you see him?

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.870
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:55.160
I mean, you know...
That guy wearing the white clothes.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:57.870
Oh, you mean the Dragonkin.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:02.910
I was in the hotel so I didn't see it,
but Sister Luna told me about him.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:07.660
When he thrust out his fist, it sent out
a shock wave that looked like a dragon...

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.370
...and sent the bad guys flying away.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:15.000
Argh, what the hell?! I'll give you Dragonkin...

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.160
Um, how come you're so
curious to know about him?

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:21.540
Is he someone you know, perhaps?

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:24.250
Hell no! I don't know him!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.500
Oh, I see...

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:32.410
I can't say it... I can't admit that guy
and me are one and the same...

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.250
Zero Kirisame...

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:40.250
Why the hell did I make that hard-ass,
delinquent, joke of a character?

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.160
Come on, Yukikaze...

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:54.370
Stop wasting money when we're short on it again.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.120
You want a lick, Mikan?

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:59.950
No, thank you. And quit talking while you eat.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:01.080
Okay.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.040
"Greatsword User" "Mikan"
Quit being dumb and let's get on with this.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.660
"Girlish Boy" "Yukikaze"
Right. I'm ready whenever.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:15.580
"Seeking able adventurers to
exterminate dangerous sandwolves"...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.830
The reward isn't bad either.

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.660
All right. Let's get rid of 'em.

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:25.500
Excuse me! We'd like to take on
that one request with the sandwolves.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:27.950
Got it. Just gimme a minute.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.330
Ooh, check this guy out.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:34.080
Is this man here a new bounty? What did he do?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.750
I guess he's claiming to be the Demon Lord.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.700
Demon Lord...

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.660
Is his thing a Demon Lord too?

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.540
What the hell are you thinking?

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.870
Luna, what happened to those soldiers?

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.750
Huh? I sent all of them home.

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:56.370
How come?
What will you do if something happens?

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:58.910
Oh, well I've got you.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:02.910
Huh? Since when did I become your bodyguard?

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:08.450
Shut up! I know you're actually happy
to be with me anyways, you pervert!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.330
You're calling me a pervert?!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.870
When have I ever done
anything perverted to you?!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:18.000
You haven't been able to forget
the feel of my butt, have you?

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.200
You butt fetish pervert!

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.120
This is so lively and fun!

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.120
I've always wanted to go on a journey like this!

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:31.120
Seriously?

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.750
Right? You tell him too, Aku!

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:37.250
You've gotta work hard and do as I say!

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.580
Ugh, the agony...

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:20.000
The other side of speed...

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.950
I'll pound you into mincemeat!

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:25.410
Dancing mad! Bring me the ball!

00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:29.290
First attacker! The phantom 6th speed!

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:31.660
Screw you, the dumb old me!

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:34.290
D-Demon Lord, what's wrong?

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:37.120
I may have danced with hard luck.

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:40.830
Demon Lord, I have no idea
what you're trying to say.

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.450
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 4.
"Yu Kirino."
